# Macro Tracker Cline Rules

## Context

This is a Flutter macro tracking application.

Before making any changes, read:
- PRODUCT_SPEC.md
- CLAUDE.md
- ui-blueprint.md
- ARCHITECTURE.md
- implementation-guide-for-ai-agents.md
- visual-design-specification.md

The implementation guide is the source of truth for coding decisions.

## Development Rules

- Follow existing architecture.
- Use Riverpod for state management.
- Use GoRouter for navigation.
- Use Freezed where existing patterns require it.
- Maintain Material 3.
- Use existing theme constants instead of hardcoded values.

## UI Rules

- Follow UI_GUIDELINES.md.
- Preserve the Nothing OS inspired design:
  - minimal
  - dark only
  - high information density
  - smooth animations
  - clean typography

Do not create generic Material UI.

## Code Changes

Before large changes:
- Explain the plan.
- List affected files.

When editing:
- Keep changes scoped.
- Do not rewrite unrelated files.
- Do not add dependencies without approval.

## Validation

After changes:
- Run flutter analyze.
- Fix introduced errors.
- Verify the app builds.